{"4282010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Devinica: Clip", "steam_appid": 4282010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282010/extras/225c3772f75d7491583023401ef69e45.poster.avif?t=1775825072\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282010/extras/225c3772f75d7491583023401ef69e45.webm?t=1775825072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282010/extras/225c3772f75d7491583023401ef69e45.mp4?t=1775825072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DEVINICA: CLIP</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bite sized AI simulation. Play as a AI computer program training in a simulated stream of mass casualty events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military AI needs training. Bonk Corp provides. Training AI on a simulated stream of swat videos and mass casualty events. Run through various procedural levels and get scored based on the amount of time you take and how many enemies you slay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack runs and further increase your score, use different weapons with various speed and damage modifiers and figure out which playstyle suits you best. Each run is perma-death. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Elements: Permadeath, Semi procedural generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Generation: Levels are random with 10,000 + variations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Movement: Lean, scope and carefully explore levels, death comes quick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Weapons: Trade speed for damage and vice versa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde Mode: Fight in cramped industrial sights against foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PROCEDUAL SIMULATION</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various level combinations with different layouts and enemy placement, no run is exactly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CLAW LEVEL EDITOR</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build custom levels using the game logic and mechanics of Devinica: Clip using CLAW, an easy to use 3d level editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the expanded lore of Devinica in this bite sized rouguelike.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282010/extras/225c3772f75d7491583023401ef69e45.poster.avif?t=1775825072\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282010/extras/225c3772f75d7491583023401ef69e45.webm?t=1775825072\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282010/extras/225c3772f75d7491583023401ef69e45.mp4?t=1775825072\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>DEVINICA: CLIP</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bite sized AI simulation. Play as a AI computer program training in a simulated stream of mass casualty events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Military AI needs training. Bonk Corp provides. Training AI on a simulated stream of swat videos and mass casualty events. Run through various procedural levels and get scored based on the amount of time you take and how many enemies you slay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack runs and further increase your score, use different weapons with various speed and damage modifiers and figure out which playstyle suits you best. Each run is perma-death. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>FEATURES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roguelike Elements: Permadeath, Semi procedural generation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural Generation: Levels are random with 10,000 + variations. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Movement: Lean, scope and carefully explore levels, death comes quick.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse Weapons: Trade speed for damage and vice versa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horde Mode: Fight in cramped industrial sights against foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>PROCEDUAL SIMULATION</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore various level combinations with different layouts and enemy placement, no run is exactly the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>CLAW LEVEL EDITOR</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build custom levels using the game logic and mechanics of Devinica: Clip using CLAW, an easy to use 3d level editor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the expanded lore of Devinica in this bite sized rouguelike.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Bite sized AI simulation.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282010/afc998a904ffafcd40471e9e476936af6d3df034/header.jpg?t=1775825072", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282010/da6b92130e417bbb23b29ff890ce6bf373fbad3c/capsul